# Normalise line endings in the repo, check out native on each machine.
#
# This project lives in a OneDrive folder and is edited from both Windows
# and Linux. Without this, a file touched on one side comes back as a
# whole-file diff on the other: an earlier session produced a commit
# showing 702 insertions and 702 deletions where nothing had actually
# changed but CRLF. That noise makes review worthless and hides real edits.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch, never diff.
*.webp binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
